At this worldwide century-old beer company, join us in driving innovation and passion in the beer industry! We are looking for ambitious ones to join our Revenue and Margin Growth (RMG) team as Management Associate. RMG is a holistic approach designed to support the Category Revenue Growth agenda in a competitive and profitable way. As part of this role, you will manage five key pillars in the commercial area: Brand Strategic Pricing, Channel Pack Price Architecture, Mix Management, Promotional, and Trade Terms Management, ensuring the company stays ahead in a highly competitive market. This position offers a unique opportunity to deepen your understanding of the beer market, sharpen your business acumen, and enhance your cross-functional communication skills, setting the stage for a rewarding career.


