Job Intro
As a Business Development & Management Associate (BDMA) at Cake, you will fully immerse yourself in industry research for market expansionÂ and recruitment strategy planning for companies of all kinds, and then zoom out to develop key accounts, and strategic partners via cold calls, email exchanges, and meetings.
