Industry Research &Â Client Sourcing:Â Manage a portfolio of growing companies by thoroughly understanding growth drivers, identifying opportunity for growth, managing risks, and creating multi-quarter plans for achievement.Business Development:Â Reach out to/call customers within a book of business to help generate growth, and a further return on investment.Project Management:Â Work closelyÂ with our C-suites, aligning workflow among team members to execute on a plan and ensure accountability to meet or exceed goals while prioritizing and delivering outstanding customer experience.Account Management: Implement creative ways to improve our customer relationships, tailor and share performance-enhancing suggestions, and promote Cake services.Strategic Partnerships: Identify key customer stakeholders, including C-level and business owners, to support PR events andÂ digital marketing plans.","Minimum Qualifications

