Hexai is an innovative technology startup focused on AI-driven cross-border e-commerce operations. By leveraging artificial intelligence and big data technologies, we enable efficient and precise operations on Amazon, the worldâ€™s largest e-commerce platform. Following a strategic investment from a publicly listed company earlier this year, we have officially entered a phase of rapid expansion. While our products were originally sold primarily in the U.S. market, we are now actively expanding into the U.K., Germany, France, Canada, and other countries.
Hexai significantly improves sales efficiency and reduces operational risks through algorithmic decision-making and automation technologies, enabling small teams to manage thousands of SKUs. Our AI system can dynamically analyze market trends, implement optimal pricing strategies, accurately place ads to increase ROAS, and optimize supply chain and inventory management to ensure products remain competitive.
Our vision is to build the future of AI-automated operations, making cross-border e-commerce smarter and more efficient, while continuously expanding the application of our technologies to more markets. If you are passionate about AI, e-commerce, data analysis, or supply chain management, we welcome you to join us in creating a new future for the AI e-commerce era!

