eering, Mechatronics, Mechanical Engineering, Physics or Computer Science.Skillsâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Ability to prioritize activities and co-ordinate a broad range of specialistsâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Ability to motivate and convince others at all levels of the organizationâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Strong technical background and a drive towards solutionsâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Strong analytical skillsâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Customer focusâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Stress tolerantâ€¢Â Â Â Â Â  Good communication skills (multi-cultural and towards different levelExcellent written and spoken English language skillsOther informationThis job will require that you work at customer sites across the globe for maximum 30% of the year. This includes international travel to Asia, the US and within Europe for uninterrupted periods of up to six weeks.This position requires access to controlled technology, as defined in the United States Export Administration Regulations (15 C.F.R. Â§ 730, et seq.). Qualified candidates must be legally authorized to access such controlled technology prior to beginning work. Business demands may require ASML to proceed with candidates who are immediately eligible to access controlled technology.Diversity and inclusionASML is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values and respects the importance of a diverse and inclusive workforce. It is the policy of the company to recruit, hire, train and promote persons in all job titles without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, or gender identity. We recognize that diversity and inclusion is a driving force in the success of our company.Need to know more about applying for a job at ASML? Read our frequently asked questions.",,https://www.cake.me/companies/ASML-Taiwan/jobs/j00321556-cs-hmi-competence-engineer-hsinchu-f7ada5e273152c272708ac5fa94088?locale=en,1001 ~ 5000 people,æ–°ç«¹å¸‚å…¬é�“äº”è·¯ä¸‰æ®µä¸€è™Ÿå��ä¸€æ¨“,"Be part of progress.
