t calls is required.Education and experienceBachelor/ Master Degree in Mechatronic/ Mechanical/Electrical Engineering is preferred.3+ years Manufacturing Engineer(ME) work experience is preferred.SkillsResult driven-demonstrate ownership and accountability.Work independently or as part of a team and follow through on assignments with minimal supervision.Â Ability to establish and maintain cooperative working relationships with manager, co-workers and customersStrong technical writing and communication skills in English, including presenting results based on strong statistical evidence to audiences of a wide range of technical abilities.This position requires access to controlled technology, as defined in the United States Export Administration Regulations (15 C.F.R. Â§ 730, et seq.). Qualified candidates must be legally authorized to access such controlled technology prior to beginning work. Business demands may require ASML to proceed with candidates who are immediately eligible to access controlled technology.Diversity and inclusionASML is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values and respects the importance of a diverse and inclusive workforce. It is the policy of the company to recruit, hire, train and promote persons in all job titles without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, or gender identity. We recognize that diversity and inclusion is a driving force in the success of our company.Need to know more about applying for a job at ASML? Read our frequently asked questions.",,https://www.cake.me/companies/ASML-Taiwan/jobs/j00321647-d-e-duv-and-yieldstar-ys-manufacturing-engineer-linko-db2996b74b5b28eab56a67c9287d94?locale=en,1001 ~ 5000 people,æ–°ç«¹å¸‚å…¬é�“äº”è·¯ä¸‰æ®µä¸€è™Ÿå��ä¸€æ¨“,"Be part of progress.
