aining arrangement, clean room test arrangement, and other office coordinatorâ€™s supporting business.Â Clean Room Support:Â Material Handler: Allocate, clean, maintain, and manage semiconductor machinery materials and components.Â Â Education:Â Graduate or undergraduate school students with a relevant major in Engineering, including Semiconductor; Electrical, Electronic, Mechanical, Mechatronics, Telecommunication...etc.Â Skills:Â Basic mechanical knowledge and familiarity with machine maintenance skill.Â Basic English communication skills are required, with a minimum English language ability of TOEIC 550 or above. (or other equivalent English certificates)Â Microsoft application skills â€“ Excel, Word, PowerPoint, Outlook.Â Pays attention to details, consistently adheres to rules, procedures and processes.Â Learning mindset, actively learns and develops based on experiences and feedback.Â Requirement:Â Working location: Tainan/ Kaohsiung, Taiwan.Â Available for on-site internship from Monday to Friday with a 09:00 to 18:00 working schedule.Â Internship length: One year duration, from July 2025 to June 2026, 12 months in total.Â Â Context of the position:Â This position is for NKUST (åœ‹ç«‹é«˜é›„ç§‘æŠ€å¤§å­¸) Internship Program, if you are student from NKUST and would like to join ASML Internship Program, please apply this position.Â Diversity and inclusion:Â ASML is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values and respects the importance of a diverse and inclusive workforce. It is the policy of the company to recruit, hire, train and promote persons in all job titles without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, or gender identity. We recognize that diversity and inclusion is a driving force in the success of our company.Â This position requires access to controlled technology, as defined in the United States Export Administration Regulations (15 C.F.R. Â§ 730, et seq.). Qualified candidates must be legally authorized to access such controlled technology prior to beginning work. Business demands may require ASML to proceed with candidates who are immediately eligible to access controlled technology.Diversity and inclusionASML is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values and respects the importance of a diverse and inclusive workforce. It is the policy of the company to recruit, hire, train and promote persons in all job titles without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, or gender identity. We recognize that diversity and inclusion is a driving force in the success of our company.Need to know more about applying for a job at ASML? Read our frequently asked questions.",,https://www.cake.me/companies/ASML-Taiwan/jobs/j00315123-taiwan-pipeline-internship-cs-euv-uir-team-tainan-ka-7922fd7f7b9dc064587736add5ef2e?locale=en,1001 ~ 5000 people,æ–°ç«¹å¸‚å…¬é�“äº”è·¯ä¸‰æ®µä¸€è™Ÿå��ä¸€æ¨“,"Be part of progress.
