Brand Marketing Executive å“�ç‰Œè¡ŒéŠ·ä¼�åŠƒ,BookAI,Artificial Intelligence / Machine Learning,Marketing / Advertising,Brand Marketer,Part-time,Entry level,"Taichung City, Taiwan",1,3 years of experience required,250 ~ 350 TWD / hour,['Google Drive'],"About Miva
Miva is an AI APP product of BookAI.Â Miva's success lies not only in our technology but in fostering a vibrant, loyal, and highly engaged user community. We are building Miva as aÂ premier AI tool for reading, learning, and knowledge management. We believe the most profound growth comes from connection and co-creation. That's why we see our community partnersâ€”independent bookstores, book club leaders, and knowledge-focused influencersâ€”as our most valuable asset. We are committed to building a long-term, mutually beneficial ecosystem based on symbiosis, not transaction.
The Opportunity
We are not looking for a traditional ""vendor manager"" or ""influencer outreach specialist."" We are searching for an ecosystem architect. You will be the central hub for Miva's external collaborations, personally driving our meticulously designed Community Partner Program. Your mission is to find the right people and empower them with Miva's resources and methodology, enabling them to grow their own ventures and influence while organically driving authentic growth for Miva.
This is a remote, part-time position. We are seeking a self-driven professional who can collaborate effectively with us during standard business hours in Taiwan (GMT+8).
What You'll Do
Ecosystem Expansion & Relationship Building:Lead the execution of the Miva Community Partner Program, identifying and engaging potential partners within the Taiwanese market (e.g., knowledge-based KOLs/KOCs, podcasters, independent bookstores, book club leaders) based on product strategy and budget.Represent Miva in partnership negotiations and planning, clearly articulating our value of ""symbiosis"" to design long-term, win-win collaborations.Project Management & Performance Evaluation:Manage the end-to-end partner lifecycle, guiding partners through our tiered growth path, from initial traffic swaps to advanced certified instructor collaborations.Design and implement a framework to measure partnership effectiveness, continuously optimizing for impact and ensuring every investment contributes meaningfully to Miva's user growth and brand influence.Brand & CEO Personal Branding:Go beyond product promotion to strategically shape the Miva brand and the founder's public image.Proactively develop and secure PR opportunities, such as media interviews and speaking engagements, to enhance Miva's visibility and professional standing in the knowledge management space.
Why You'll Love BookAI
Flexibility & Autonomy: Enjoy the freedom of a part-time, remote role while having the stage to lead significant, impactful projects.Core Impact: You will work directly with the founder to build Miva's most critical community moat. Your achievements will have a direct and visible impact on the company's growth trajectory.A Culture of Co-creation: We offer more than just a salary. We offer an opportunity to apply your expertise, grow alongside a team of smart and passionate people, and share in the rewards of our collective success.

