cal design engineer role.Skillsâ€¢ Highly motivated personality with strong ownership and leadership mentality.â€¢ Candidate must have strong communicative skills in English with a commitment to achieving results on time.â€¢ Willingness to take on responsibility, follow through and keep multiple simultaneous assignments on schedule.â€¢ Desire to grow into position of task leadership & project planning.â€¢ Is familiar with NX modeling SW and mechanical tolerance analysis, material selection and surface treatment.This position requires access to controlled technology, as defined in the United States Export Administration Regulations (15 C.F.R. Â§ 730, et seq.). Qualified candidates must be legally authorized to access such controlled technology prior to beginning work. Business demands may require ASML to proceed with candidates who are immediately eligible to access controlled technology.Diversity and inclusionASML is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values and respects the importance of a diverse and inclusive workforce. It is the policy of the company to recruit, hire, train and promote persons in all job titles without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, or gender identity. We recognize that diversity and inclusion is a driving force in the success of our company.Need to know more about applying for a job at ASML? Read our frequently asked questions.",,https://www.cake.me/companies/ASML-Taiwan/jobs/j00320901-d-e-duv-and-yieldstar-ys-mechanical-design-engineer-li-8fb3d8068c37e39e572f48e24e55b2?locale=en,1001 ~ 5000 people,æ–°ç«¹å¸‚å…¬é�“äº”è·¯ä¸‰æ®µä¸€è™Ÿå��ä¸€æ¨“,"Be part of progress.
