D&E - EUV Top Module Mechatronics Design Engineer - Hsinchu,ASML Taiwan 台灣艾司摩爾,Semiconductor,Engineering,Other,Full-time,Entry level,"Hsinchu City, Taiwan",1,2 years of experience required,Negotiable,[],"IntroductionWithin ASML, the Wilton DE Satellite team represents the development projects responsible for Wilton DE product ownership in Asia.This position will be located in ASML TW Hsinchu office and reports to WT DE OS&I LF Satellite Team GL in TW and assigned to NXE EUV Top Module Escalation(TME) project in Wilton to support WW NXE EUV Top Module Escalation.Job MissionYou will be the Wilton DE representative in TW working & WLT TME team for supporting WW NXE EUV Top Module Escalation project as EUV Top Module expert. This role is to act as frontline DE in field, covering the local time zone escalation in time and feedback Wilton TME DE the issue progress and improvement. Home base will be in ASML Hsinchu office, TW.The mission of WLT NXE EUV TME DE is to enable our field service engineers’ solving power on NXE EUV Top Module to be capable in supporting our customers. As an NXE EUV reticle Stage expert, you will function as the technical interface between Global Support Center and WLT DE teams to solve issue in time and feedback structural improvement. As an Mechatronics Design Engineer, you need to fully understand the EUV reticle stage design and functionality, develop DE level diagnostics skill, and further proposed effective containment and solution.Job DescriptionAble to clarify the issue for accurate problem description, root cause deep-dive and drive for solution from technical perspective and have helicopter view of EUV top module issues.Knowledge/experience of robotics and stage controls is desirable.Review/study EUV top module design change document to have up to date design info and provide comments to Wilton DE.Able to provide quick containment with data driven analysis for NXE EUV top module issues in field.Manage the lifecycle(E2E) of an action plan that needs to be executed at the customer site.Communicate the issue status updates on a daily basis with WLT DE TME teamManage customer’s expectation and able to bring the customer needs to the D&E project to close gap.Interact with EUV DE colleagues in Wilton for driving the containment and solution.This position requires access to controlled technology, as defined in the United States Export Administration Regulations (15 C.F.R. § 730, et seq.). Qualified candidates must be legally authorized to access such controlled technology prior to beginning work. Business demands may require ASML to proceed with candidates who are immediately eligible to access controlled technology.Diversity and inclusionASML is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values and respects the importance of a diverse and inclusive workforce. It is the policy of the company to recruit, hire, train and promote persons in all job titles without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, or gender identity. We recognize that diversity and inclusion is a driving force in the success of our company.Need to know more about applying for a job at ASML? Read our frequently asked questions.",,https://www.cake.me/companies/ASML-Taiwan/jobs/j00319068-d-e-euv-top-module-mechatronics-design-engineer-hsinchu-7f6da9e15c3901bd45b6fd45c0937d?locale=en,1001 ~ 5000 people,新竹市公道五路三段一號十一樓,"Be part of progress.
